From: Oliphaunt Maintainers <dev@oliphaunt.dev>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wasmer-js: stream direct protocol and bound tool capture

Add bounded protocol callbacks, direct tool execution and aggregate bounded
stdout/stderr capture. The transport follows the shared guest contract and
preserves owned callback bytes; capture overflow fails instead of returning a
partial successful result. These are coupled downstream protocol/tool adapters,
not a claim that the bundled patch is ready for upstream as one change.

